%% SYS-BEH22
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Buyer as 买家
  participant UI as 领券/结算页
  participant VC as VoucherController
  participant VS as VoucherService
  participant OS as OrderService
  participant DB as MySQL
  Buyer->>UI: 领取优惠券
  UI->>VC: POST /vouchers/{id}/claim
  VC->>VS: 校验并领取
  VS->>DB: INSERT user_voucher
  DB-->>Buyer: 领取结果
  Buyer->>UI: 选择券并提交订单
  UI->>OS: 创建订单(voucherId)
  OS->>VS: 校验并核销
  VS->>DB: 更新 user_voucher/voucher
  OS->>DB: 保存优惠后订单
  OS-->>Buyer: 待支付订单
